vatan (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First public release.
  * Island panel at the bottom with dock, Komut button, workspace button,
    status and clock; menus open upward, banners and OSD sit above it.
  * Komut command bar: apps, files, settings, calculator and Turkish
    actions such as "karanlık", "parlaklık 40" or "ses 30".
  * Lock screen with a corner clock, Geist and Instrument Serif fonts,
    Turkey contour wallpaper in light and dark.
  * Installs as its own session next to GNOME.

